AltoVesting::claim
├── when contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with IsPaused
├── when sender is not authorized to act on behalf of onBehalf
│   └── it should revert with AltoVestingUnauthorized
├── when vesting duration is zero
│   └── it should revert with AltoVestingInvalidInput
├── when merkle proof is invalid
│   ├── given proof does not verify against merkle root
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoVestingInvalidInput
│   └── given vesting info does not match provided parameters
│       └── it should revert with AltoVestingInvalidInput
├── when user has already claimed the full vested amount
│   ├── given claimed amount equals vested amount
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoVestingNotEnoughVestedAmount
│   └── given claimed amount exceeds vested amount
│       └── it should revert with AltoVestingNotEnoughVestedAmount
├── when vesting has not started
│   ├── given current timestamp is before startAt
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoVestingInvalidInput
│   └── given current timestamp equals startAt
│       └── it should revert with AltoVestingInvalidInput
└── when all conditions are met for valid claim
    ├── when vesting is fully vested
    │   ├── given current timestamp is after startAt + vestingDuration
    │   ├── it should calculate vested amount as totalVestingAmount
    │   ├── it should transfer full claimable amount to onBehalf
    │   ├── it should update claimed mapping to totalVestingAmount
    │   ├── it should emit ClaimVesting event with correct parameters
    │   └── it should return the claimed amount
    ├── when vesting is partially vested
    │   ├── given current timestamp is between startAt and startAt + vestingDuration
    │   ├── it should calculate vested amount proportionally
    │   ├── it should transfer claimable amount to onBehalf
    │   ├── it should update claimed mapping to calculated vested amount
    │   ├── it should emit ClaimVesting event with correct parameters
    │   └── it should return the claimed amount
    ├── when user has partially claimed before
    │   ├── given user has claimed some amount previously
    │   ├── it should calculate remaining claimable amount
    │   ├── it should transfer only remaining amount to onBehalf
    │   ├── it should update claimed mapping to new vested amount
    │   ├── it should emit ClaimVesting event with remaining amount
    │   └── it should return the newly claimed amount
    └── when sender is authorized but not the onBehalf user
        ├── it should transfer tokens to onBehalf address
        ├── it should update claimed mapping for onBehalf
        ├── it should emit ClaimVesting event with correct caller and onBehalf
        └── it should return the claimed amount
